{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras/794733f69e0b458c81adafa85bd5c3e4.avif?t=1768315928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras_big/794733f69e0b458c81adafa85bd5c3e4.webp?t=1768315928 width=1560 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of the rails</strong> in<strong><i> SwitchTrack</i></strong>, a coordination puzzle game. Use well timed inputs to move the tracks and guide the incoming minecarts across each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras/4d5b65487fd0da2e40f2dea0cf7e9ac8.poster.avif?t=1768315928\" width=572 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras/4d5b65487fd0da2e40f2dea0cf7e9ac8.webm?t=1768315928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage The Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilise the different tracks\u00a0</strong>and time your levers well to avoid dangers and crashes. Master each level's rhythm to maximise your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rails can get busy so you must keep an eye on multiple carts at once to ensure they all make it safely across each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tracks are connected to the same input, so make sure it's the right decision before pulling that lever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916040?t=1768315928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/9282cc61d34ef1c6dcf8b9e33aaf6264396f1487/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768315928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/0d783a4fe5696d4f3deac19f0c2ff493ed33c41d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768315928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/0d783a4fe5696d4f3deac19f0c2ff493ed33c41d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768315928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3916970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras/794733f69e0b458c81adafa85bd5c3e4.avif?t=1768315928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras_big/794733f69e0b458c81adafa85bd5c3e4.webp?t=1768315928 width=1560 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of the rails</strong> in<strong><i> SwitchTrack</i></strong>, a coordination puzzle game. Use well timed inputs to move the tracks and guide the incoming minecarts across each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras/4d5b65487fd0da2e40f2dea0cf7e9ac8.poster.avif?t=1768315928\" width=572 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/extras/4d5b65487fd0da2e40f2dea0cf7e9ac8.webm?t=1768315928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage The Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilise the different tracks\u00a0</strong>and time your levers well to avoid dangers and crashes. Master each level's rhythm to maximise your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rails can get busy so you must keep an eye on multiple carts at once to ensure they all make it safely across each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tracks are connected to the same input, so make sure it's the right decision before pulling that lever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Rootward Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916040/52dcce1f0fd1527683786f51f7c32cf5778d55f0/header.jpg?t=1768315928","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916040/1534317548/34bd3671cebdb1a1ecbb481426f5e70318655407/1768315007/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768315927","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916040/1534317548/34bd3671cebdb1a1ecbb481426f5e70318655407/1768315007/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768315927","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916040/1534317548/34bd3671cebdb1a1ecbb481426f5e70318655407/1768315007/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768315927","id":257198806,"name":"SwitchTrack Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a